    "body": "## Summary\n\nThis change reworks how the example service retries failed requests. The previous loop retried immediately and could hammer the upstream.\n\n## Details\n\n- Add exponential backoff with jitter\n- Cap the delay at 30 seconds\n- Add tests for the cap and the jitter bounds\n\n## Testing\n\nRan the unit tests and the integration suite locally.\n",
